# Transform/stream contract freeze (v0.8.0)

Frozen types live in `crates/parqonaut-workflow`:

- `ProgressEvent`, `ProgressObserver`, `ProgressMetrics`
- `SchemaConflictPolicy`
- `StreamCheckpoint`, `StreamExecutionIdentity` (contract sketch; stream runtime uses `parqonaut-stream::state`)
- `TransformPlan`, `TransformOperation`, `TransformReport`, `TRANSFORM_SPEC_SCHEMA_VERSION`

## Content digest (not a Git commit)

SHA-256 over the concatenated hashes of `crates/parqonaut-workflow/src/*.rs`:

```text
TRANSFORM_STREAM_CONTRACT_DIGEST=6e12d29eb0be19c154e46855dd558f3649029535c304cd281181da2deb591e10
```

Regenerate after intentional contract changes:

```bash
shasum -a 256 crates/parqonaut-workflow/src/*.rs | shasum -a 256
```

## Git commit that records this freeze

Set after the freeze commit lands on the release branch:

```text
TRANSFORM_STREAM_CONTRACT_COMMIT=d4a9d5fa43da312ee5fc5e8f9eb78d45d8fbb79c
```

Do not confuse the 64-character content digest with a Git object name.
